Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 11:07:37 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] source_info: delta-encode the bytecode to source map

The map spent 12 bytes per entry (pc, line, column) and a bundle has an
entry every few instructions. Store pc/line/column deltas as varints,
with a checkpoint every 32 entries so a position lookup decodes at most
32 entries; positions are only read to build error stacks.
